cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Black Hole Statistical Mechanics: From Horizon Thermodynamics to Quantum Entanglement and Information Recovery"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational-physics repository (Python package bhstatmech) on black-hole thermodynamics,
  Hawking radiation, quantum entanglement, Page curves, toy island models, holographic entropy, scrambling and
  quantum error correction. Many components are toy models; see docs/limitations.md.
authors:
  - name: "black-hole-statistical-mechanics contributors"
keywords:
  - black hole thermodynamics
  - Hawking radiation
  - entanglement entropy
  - Page curve
  - information paradox
